<script setup lang="ts">import {openPath} from '../shared/desktop';import type {Workbench} from '../app/useWorkbench';import JsonReport from '../shared/JsonReport.vue';const {w}=defineProps<{w:Workbench}>();const s=w.s;</script>
<template><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">ASSEMBLY REVIEW</div><h1>确认来源、目标与影响范围</h1><p>预览与写入分为两步。修改任何输入后，都需要重新预览。</p></div></div><section v-if="w.preview.record" class="card"><div class="card-heading"><span class="card-icon">↔</span><div><h2>本次装配预览</h2><p>基础资源补齐保留已有文件，目标覆盖前建立备份</p></div><el-tag :type="w.canApplyPreview()?'success':'warning'">{{w.canApplyPreview()?'预览有效':'预览已过期'}}</el-tag></div><div class="source-target"><div><span>来源 SOURCE</span><code>{{w.preview.record.report?.source||w.preview.record.body.schema_source||'项目完整样例模板'}}</code></div><b>→</b><div><span>目标 DESTINATION</span><code>{{w.preview.record.report?.destination||w.preview.record.body.job_name+'.xml'}}</code></div></div><dl class="definition-list"><dt>XML 根任务名</dt><dd>{{w.preview.record.report?.runtime_name||w.preview.record.body.job_name}}</dd><dt>实际输出目录</dt><dd class="mono">{{w.preview.record.report?.out_dir||'装配后按实际 XML 核验'}}</dd><dt>资源选择</dt><dd>天线 {{w.preview.record.body.copy_antennas?'装配':'保留现有'}} · 模型 {{w.preview.record.body.copy_files?'装配':'保留现有'}}</dd></dl><el-table :data="w.preview.record.report?.changes||[]" empty-text="样例新建，按所选任务与地图装配"><el-table-column prop="tag" label="字段" min-width="150"/><el-table-column prop="old" label="原值" min-width="220"/><el-table-column prop="new" label="目标值" min-width="220"/></el-table><el-alert v-for="warning in w.preview.record.report?.warnings||[]" :key="warning" :title="warning" type="warning" show-icon :closable="false" class="spaced-alert"/><div class="button-row"><el-button @click="w.previewAssembly" :disabled="!!s.pending||s.runtime.busy">重新预览</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="w.assemble" :disabled="!w.canApplyPreview()||!!s.pending||s.runtime.busy">确认装配当前预览</el-button></div></section><section v-else class="card"><el-empty :description="s.job?'已加载运行配置；直接使用模式无需装配。':'请在任务与输入阶段选择资源，并生成装配预览。'" :image-size="100"><el-button type="primary" plain @click="s.stage=s.job?4:2">{{s.job?'进入参数与检查':'选择任务与输入'}}</el-button></el-empty></section><section v-if="s.assembly" class="card"><div class="card-heading"><span class="card-icon teal">✓</span><div><h2>最近装配报告</h2><p>文件复制、运行资源、备份、Visual Studio 启动项与恢复状态</p></div></div><el-alert :title="s.assembly.assembly_status==='applied'?'装配已应用':s.assembly.assembly_status==='rolled_back'?'装配未完成，本次变更已回滚':s.assembly.assembly_status==='recovery_required'?'恢复需要核对，请保留报告中的恢复快照':'运行配置已加载'" :type="s.assembly.assembly_status==='recovery_required'?'error':'info'" :closable="false" show-icon/><div v-if="s.assembly.recovery_dir" class="recovery-evidence"><strong>恢复快照需要保留与核对</strong><code>{{s.assembly.recovery_dir}}</code><p>本次装配未确认恢复完成。保留此快照，核对报告中的文件状态后再继续。</p><el-button @click="openPath(s.assembly.recovery_dir)">打开恢复快照目录</el-button></div><pre v-if="s.assembly.render_output" class="output-report">{{s.assembly.render_output}}</pre><el-table v-if="s.assembly.base_resources?.copied?.length" :data="s.assembly.base_resources.copied"><el-table-column prop="from" label="资源来源"/><el-table-column prop="to" label="实际目标"/></el-table><JsonReport :data="s.assembly" title="查看完整装配、备份与恢复报告"/></section></template>
